    "\n",
    "- **Luke** - Helped in data processing; choosing relevant bookmakers and evaluating gaps. Deciphered any code found online and wrote our conclusion.\n"
    "\n",
    "Work-load was split equally, 25% per person.\n"
   ]
  }
